            "id": 82610,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan keuntungan terbesar yang diperoleh selama empat minggu terakhir dalam variabel <code>max_profit</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"weekly_profits = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"max_profit = max(weekly_profits)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max_profit)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"66\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"70\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>max_profit</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>max(weekly_profits)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan keuntungan terbesar dari <code>weekly_profits</code> dalam <code>max_profit</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>70</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"weekly_profits = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"max_profit = max(weekly_profits)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max_profit)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min(weekly_profits)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"70\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>max_profit</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>max(weekly_profits)</code>.</p></body></html>",
